---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '中国240小时免签过境（2026）——中国入门指南';
const description = 'Everything you need to know about China 240-hour visa-free transit policy.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/prepare/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Prepare
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">📋 入境和签证</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        China 240-Hour Visa-Free Transit Explained
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">你可以在没有签证的情况下访问中国长达10天吗？</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读7分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>是的，在许多情况下。</strong> China's 240-hour visa-free transit policy lets eligible travelers stay in permitted regions for up to 10 days while traveling onward to a third country or region. You need a passport from one of 55 eligible countries and a confirmed onward ticket.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Table of Contents -->
    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#requirements" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">✅ 要获得资格，您必须满足所有这些要求</a></li>
        <li><a href="#routes" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🔄 符合条件与不符合条件的路线</a></li>
        <li><a href="#countries" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🌍 哪些国家符合条件？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#ports" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">✈️ 你可以在哪里进出中国？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#documents" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📄 你需要什么文件？</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>是的，在许多情况下。</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        China's 240-hour visa-free transit policy lets eligible travelers stay in permitted regions of China for up to 10 days while traveling onward to a third country or region. For many visitors, this is one of the easiest ways to see China without applying for a traditional visa.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="requirements" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">✅</span> To Qualify, You Must Meet ALL These Requirements
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-5 bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-green-200 text-green-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">有效普通护照</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">来自55个符合条件的国家之一；护照必须自抵达之日起至少3个月内有效</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-5 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-200 text-blue-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">符合条件的行程</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">国家A→ mainland china→ 不同的国家/地区（您不能直接飞回原籍国）</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-5 bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-purple-200 text-purple-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">已确认的续程机票</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">固定出发日期和座位，240小时内出发</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-5 bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-xl">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-orange-200 text-orange-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">批准的出入境口岸</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">在允许的时限内通过官方批准的过境口岸出入境</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900 m-0"><strong>重要提示：</strong> This is strictly a transit policy, not a general tourist visa-free entry.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="routes" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🔄</span> Eligible vs. Ineligible Routes
      </h2>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-green-700 mb-3">✅ 符合条件（有效过境）</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700 pl-4 list-disc">
            <li>英国→ 上海→ Japan</li>
            <li>美国→ 北京→ 韩国</li>
            <li>澳大利亚→ 广州→ 泰国</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-600 mb-3">❌ 不符合条件（往返）</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700 pl-4 list-disc">
            <li>英国→ 上海→ 英国</li>
            <li>美国→ 北京→ 美国</li>
            <li>日本→ 上海→ Japan</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏛️</span> Does Hong Kong/Macau/Taiwan Count as a Third Region?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>对。</strong> Under official immigration rules, Hong Kong, Macau, and Taiwan are treated as separate third destinations for transit qualification.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>例子：</strong> United Kingdom → Shanghai → Hong Kong = valid transit itinerary.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">⏱️</span> How Long Can You Stay?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-2">
        <strong>最长停留时间：</strong> 240 hours (10 days).
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>时钟什么时候开始？</strong> The countdown begins at 00:00 midnight on the calendar day after your entry (China local time, GMT+8) — not when your plane actually lands.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>专业提示：</strong> If you arrive late in the evening, you'll get some extra practical buffer time beyond the full 10 calendar days.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="countries" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🌍</span> Which Countries Are Eligible?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Total: <strong>55个国家</strong>.</p>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2">欧洲（40个国家）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">阿尔巴尼亚、奥地利、白俄罗斯、比利时、波斯尼亚和黑塞哥维那、保加利亚、克罗地亚、塞浦路斯、捷克共和国、丹麦、爱沙尼亚、芬兰、法国、德国、希腊、匈牙利、冰岛、爱尔兰、意大利、拉脱维亚、立陶宛、卢森堡、马耳他、摩纳哥、黑山、荷兰、北马其顿、挪威、波兰、葡萄牙、罗马尼亚、俄罗斯、塞尔维亚、斯洛伐克、斯洛文尼亚、西班牙、瑞典、瑞士、乌克兰、英国</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2">北美（3个国家）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">加拿大、墨西哥、美国</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-orange-800 mb-2">南美洲（3个国家）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">阿根廷、巴西、智利</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-2">大洋洲（2个国家）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">澳大利亚、新西兰</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800 mb-2">亚洲（7个国家）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">文莱、印度尼西亚、日本、卡塔尔、新加坡、韩国、阿拉伯联合酋长国</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>注：</strong> The official country list is updated occasionally. Always verify the latest information via official government sources before booking flights.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="ports" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">✈️</span> Where Can You Enter and Exit China?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        You can enter and exit through any of <strong>65个指定端口</strong> across <strong>24个省（含直辖市、自治区）</strong>. Cross-province travel is <strong>允许</strong> — you can enter through Shanghai, take a high-speed train to Beijing, and fly home from Beijing. The entire itinerary must stay within the 24 designated provinces/regions.
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">省/市</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">关键端口</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">住宿区域</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">紫禁城、长城、胡同、颐和园</td><td class="px-4 py-2">首都国际机场（北京），大兴国际机场(PKX)</td><td class="px-4 py-2">紫禁城、长城、胡同、颐和园</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">迪士尼（可选），黄山一日游，深入城市</td><td class="px-4 py-2">浦东（PVG），虹桥（SHA），海港口岸</td><td class="px-4 py-2">迪士尼（可选），黄山一日游，深入城市</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">广东</td><td class="px-4 py-2">广州（可以），深圳（SZX），揭阳（SWA）+海港</td><td class="px-4 py-2">广东省</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">江苏</td><td class="px-4 py-2">南京（NKG），无锡（WUX），扬州（YTY），连云港海港</td><td class="px-4 py-2">江苏</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">浙江</td><td class="px-4 py-2">杭州（HGH），宁波（NGB），温州（WNZ）等</td><td class="px-4 py-2">浙江</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">四川</td><td class="px-4 py-2">成都双流（CTU），成都天府(TFU)</td><td class="px-4 py-2">成都+10其他城市</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">（6-10天）：昆明、大理、丽江、香格里拉</td><td class="px-4 py-2">昆明(KMG)</td><td class="px-4 py-2">昆明+8个市/州</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">广西</td><td class="px-4 py-2">南宁（NNG），桂林（KWL），北海(BHY)</td><td class="px-4 py-2">南宁+11其他城市</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">福建</td><td class="px-4 py-2">福州（FOC），厦门（XMN），泉州(JJN)</td><td class="px-4 py-2">福建</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">海南</td><td class="px-4 py-2">海口（HAK），三亚(SYX)</td><td class="px-4 py-2">海南岛</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">陕西</td><td class="px-4 py-2">西安(XIY)</td><td class="px-4 py-2">陕西</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">重庆</td><td class="px-4 py-2">重庆(CKG)</td><td class="px-4 py-2">重庆</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">天津</td><td class="px-4 py-2">天津（TSN），天津海港</td><td class="px-4 py-2">天津</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">+11个省</td><td class="px-4 py-2" colspan="2">河北、辽宁、山东、河南、湖北、湖南、安徽、贵州、山西、黑龙江、江西——每个都有指定的机场/海港</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>重要提示：</strong> You can travel freely within the 24 designated provinces/regions during your 240-hour stay. For example, fly into Shanghai, take the high-speed train to Beijing, and fly home from Beijing — that's all allowed as long as you leave within 10 days. The key rule is that you must exit China within 240 hours; where you enter and exit can be different ports.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="documents" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📄</span> What Documents Do You Need?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Prepare these documents for airline check-in and border immigration inspection:
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-5 bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-green-200 text-green-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">有效护照原件</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">剩余有效期至少3个月</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-5 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-200 text-blue-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">已确认的续程机票</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">登机前所需的固定出发日期和座位；不接受开放日期的门票</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-5 bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-purple-200 text-purple-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">详细旅行行程</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">展示您在中国计划的活动</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-5 bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-xl">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-orange-200 text-orange-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">酒店/住宿预订证明</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">边境当局强烈建议</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">选择离您最近的中心——每个中心覆盖特定地区</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://www.nia.gov.cn/n741440/n741577/c1731205/content.html" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">国家移民局过境免签政策 （24个省，65个港口，55个国家）</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://english.www.gov.cn/policies/featured/202412/20/content_WS676548cbc6d0868f4e8ee28f.html" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">English.gov.cn——中国240小时过境免签证政策</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">一些中心接受步行入内，通常在清晨。在当地中心的网站上查看他们的政策。</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">第三步：访问签证中心</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-free/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">中国免签证国家名单（2026年）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">在预约当天前往签证中心。</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/apply-l-visa/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">如何申请旅游签证（L型）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">分步指南</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>